        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Roberts, Kathleen Hanna\n- Bands: Bikini Kill, Le Tigre\n- Songs: \"Without a Map\"\n- Companies: Universal (Canada)\n\nFacts:\n- Sam Roberts was born on October 2, 1974.\n- In the early-to-mid-1990s, Kathleen Hanna was the lead singer of Bikini Kill.\n- In 1997, Bikini Kill disbanded after releasing two full-length albums, several EPs, and two compilations.\n- In the late 1990s and early 2000s, Kathleen Hanna fronted Le Tigre.\n- Since 2002, Sam Roberts has been signed to Universal (Canada).\n- Sam Roberts is a Canadian rock singer-songwriter who has released six albums.\n- \"Without a Map\" is a song by Canadian musician Sam Roberts.",
